abstract: >
  SocialBeliefTrace is a regenerable evaluation artifact for misinformation-aware
  social agents with inspectable needs, trust, and source-confidence beliefs,
  schema-versioned JSONL traces, diagnostic scenarios, and mechanism/policy metrics.
  Formerly released as BeliefBench v0.1.0.
